          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "3JN 1:1",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "The elder to the beloved Gaius, whom I love in truth.",
        "\n"
      ],
      "marker": "p",
      "type": "para"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "3JN 1:2",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "Beloved, I pray that in all respects you may prosper and be in good health, just as your soul prospers.",
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "3JN 1:3",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "For I was overjoyed when brothers came and testified to your truth, ",
        {
          "content": [
            "that is,"
          ],
          "marker": "it",
          "type": "char"
        },
        " how you are walking in truth.",
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "3JN 1:4",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "I have no greater joy than ",
        {
          "content": [
            "1 ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "1:4 ",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "Lit ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "these things, that I hear",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "f",
          "type": "note"
        },
        "this, to hear of my children walking in the truth.",
        "\n"
      ],
      "marker": "p",
      "type": "para"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "3JN 1:5",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "Beloved, you are acting faithfully in whatever you accomplish for the brothers ",
        {
          "content": [
            "and sisters,"
          ],
          "marker": "it",
          "type": "char"
        },
        " and ",
        {
          "content": [
            "1 ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "1:5 ",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "Lit ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "this",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "f",
          "type": "note"
        },
        "especially ",
        {
          "content": [
            "when they are"
          ],
          "marker": "it",
          "type": "char"
        },
        " strangers;",
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "3JN 1:6",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "and they have testified to your love before the church. You will do well to ",
        {
          "content": [
            "1 ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "1:6 ",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "I.e., give them whatever they might need for the journey",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "f",
          "type": "note"
        },
        "send them on their way in a manner worthy of God.",
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "3JN 1:7",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "For they went out for the sake of the Name, accepting nothing from the Gentiles.",
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "3JN 1:8",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "Therefore we ought to ",
        {
          "content": [
            "1 ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "1:8 ",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "Or ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "receive as guests",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "f",
          "type": "note"
        },
        "support such people, so that we may ",
        {
          "content": [
            "2 ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "1:8 ",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "Or ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "become fellow",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "f",
          "type": "note"
        },
        "prove to be fellow workers ",
        {
          "content": [
            "3 ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "1:8 ",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "Or ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "for",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "f",
          "type": "note"
        },
        "with the truth.",
        "\n"
      ],
      "marker": "p",
      "type": "para"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "3JN 1:9",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "I wrote something to the church; but Diotrephes, who loves to be first among them, does not accept ",
        {
          "content": [
            "1 ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "1:9 ",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "Lit ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "us",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "f",
          "type": "note"
        },
        "what we say.",
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "3JN 1:10",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "For this reason, if I come, I will call attention to his deeds which he does, unjustly accusing us with malicious words; and not satisfied with this, he himself does not receive the brothers either, and he forbids those who want ",
        {
          "content": [
            "to do so"
          ],
          "marker": "it",
          "type": "char"
        },
        " and puts ",
        {
          "content": [
            "them"
          ],
          "marker": "it",
          "type": "char"
        },
        " out of the church.",
        "\n"
      ],
      "marker": "p",
      "type": "para"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "3JN 1:11",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "Beloved, do not imitate what is evil, but what is good. The one who does what is good is of God; the one who does what is evil has not seen God.",
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "3JN 1:12",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "Demetrius has received a ",
        {
          "content": [
            "good"
          ],
          "marker": "it",
          "type": "char"
        },
        " testimony from everyone, and from the truth itself; and we testify too, and you know that our testimony is true.",
        "\n"
      ],
      "marker": "p",
      "type": "para"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "3JN 1:13",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "I had many things to write to you, but I do not want to write to you with pen and ink;",
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "3JN 1:14",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "but I hope to see you shortly, and we will speak ",
        {
          "content": [
            "1 ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "1:14 ",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "fr",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "Lit ",
            {
              "closing": false,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            "mouth to mouth",
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "it",
              "type": "marker"
            },
            {
              "closing": true,
              "marker": "ft",
              "type": "marker"
            }
          ],
          "marker": "f",
          "type": "note"
        },
        "face to face.",
        "\n"
      ],
      "marker": "p",
      "type": "para"
    },
    {
      "content": [
        "\n",
        {
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "3JN 1:15",
          "type": "verse"
        },
        "Peace ",
        {
          "content": [
            "be"
          ],
          "marker": "it",
          "type": "char"
        },
        " to you. The friends greet you. Greet the friends by name.",
        "\n"
      ],
      "marker": "p",
      "type": "para"
    }
